<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market mostly quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market mostly quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa Southern Minnesota Direct cattle on a live basis were not well tested, while no sales were reported on a dressed basis.</p>
<p>Live basis:</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs couple lds 68.25</p>
<p>Carcass basis: Steers and heifers not tested.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
</text>
